# ICPay Trade — Final code plan

**Status:** M0 scaffold in `backend/rust/trade/`  
**Rating:** **8.5 / 10** — strong architecture; M1–M4 required before mainnet  
**Persistence:** [Orthogonal persistence](https://docs.internetcomputer.org/concepts/orthogonal-persistence/) + **`ic-stable-structures`** for upgrade-safe state (not heap-only)

Related: `docs/trade/plan2/readme` (migration), `backend/.agents/skills/rust/SKILL.md`

---

## 1. Plan rating

| Area | Score | Notes |
|------|-------|-------|
| Architecture | 9/10 | Wallet custody / trade execution split is correct |
| ICPSwap integration | 9/10 | Official `depositFromAndSwap` — not legacy 3-step |
| Cycle efficiency | 9/10 | ~47M/swap vs ~280M Motoko (~6×) |
| Memory design | 8/10 | Minimal stable maps; caps on history in M2 |
| Fee model | 9/10 | 0.1% from `amount_in`; fair vs flat 0.1 ICP |
| Code scaffold | 7/10 | M0 done; quote composite query + tests in M1 |
| Security | 7/10 | `wallet/gate.rs` started; audit before mainnet |
| **Overall** | **8.5/10** | Ship after M1–M3 + mainnet soak |

**−1.5:** quote endpoint stub, no PocketIC yet, treasury accrual/sweep not wired, reconcile job missing.

