## 2. Repository layout

```
backend/
├── dfx.json                          # icpay_trade rust canister entry
└── rust/trade/
    ├── Cargo.toml                    # ic-cdk 0.19, candid 0.10, icrc-ledger-types 0.1
    ├── trade_canister.did            # generated: cargo build + candid-extractor
    └── src/
        ├── lib.rs                    # init, post_upgrade, export_candid!
        ├── config.rs                 # factory, fees, ledger ids
        ├── types.rs                  # ApiResult, SwapQuoteResult, InitArgs
        ├── domain/
        │   ├── fees.rs               # 0.1% + tests ✓
        │   └── quote.rs              # pure quote math + tests ✓
        ├── ledger/
        │   └── icrc.rs               # icrc1_transfer, icrc1_fee (explicit fee)
        ├── icpswap/
        │   ├── types.rs              # Candid shapes, token standard
        │   ├── factory.rs            # getPool (parallel tiers in M1)
        │   └── pool.rs               # quote, depositFromAndSwap
        ├── storage/                    # orthogonal persistence via stable memory
        │   ├── mod.rs                # MemoryManager, CONFIG StableCell
        │   ├── pools.rs              # pair → pool cache
        │   └── balances.rs           # (user, token) → trading balance
        ├── wallet/
        │   └── gate.rs               # wallet-only + reject anonymous
        └── api/
            ├── quote.rs              # get_swap_quote (M1)
            ├── swap.rs               # execute_swap
            └── wallet.rs               # credit_from_wallet, debit_to_wallet
```

**Max ~300 lines per file** — split further if `api/swap.rs` grows.

---

## 3. Orthogonal persistence (official model)

From [ICP orthogonal persistence](https://docs.internetcomputer.org/concepts/orthogonal-persistence/):

| Memory | Survives update call | Survives upgrade |
|--------|----------------------|------------------|
| Wasm heap (`Vec`, `HashMap`) | Yes | **No** |
| **Stable memory** (`StableBTreeMap`, etc.) | Yes | **Yes** |

**ICPay rule:** all balances, pool cache, config → **stable structures only**.  
Heap allowed for single-call scratch only.

```rust
// storage/mod.rs — pattern from DFINITY stable-structures guide
thread_local! {
    static MEMORY_MANAGER: RefCell<MemoryManager<...>> = ...;
    static CONFIG: RefCell<StableCell<CanisterConfig, Memory>> = ...;
}
```

`MemoryId` constants are **never renumbered** after mainnet (see rust SKILL).

---

## 4. ICPSwap — official flow

| Step | API | Type |
|------|-----|------|
| Find pool | `SwapFactory.getPool` | query |
| Price | `SwapPool.quote` | query |
| **Execute** | **`SwapPool.depositFromAndSwap`** | **update** |
| Stuck funds | `getUserUnusedBalance` + `withdraw` | query + update |

Refs:
- [Executing DepositFromAndSwap](https://github.com/ICPSwap-Labs/docs/blob/main/02.SwapPool/Swap/04.Executing_DepositFromAndSwap.md)
- [Getting a Quote](https://github.com/ICPSwap-Labs/docs/blob/main/02.SwapPool/Swap/01.Getting_a_Quote.md)

**Token `standard`:** `ICP` | `ICRC2` (chain-key) | `ICRC1` (SNS) — must match factory.

---

## 5. Fee model — 0.1%

```rust
pub const SERVICE_FEE_BPS: u64 = 10; // 0.1%

pub fn service_fee(amount_in: u64) -> u64 {
    (amount_in * SERVICE_FEE_BPS / 10_000).max(1)
}
```

| Swap | Old (0.1 ICP flat) | New (0.1%) |
|------|-------------------|------------|
| 1 ICP | 0.1 ICP | 0.001 ICP |
| 100 ICP | 0.1 ICP | 0.1 ICP |
| ckBTC → ICP | needs 0.1 ICP balance | fee from ckBTC input |

**Treasury:** accrue on trade main; hourly `ic-cdk-timers` sweep (M2) — **0 IC writes per swap**.

---

## 6. ICRC transfers (explicit fee)

Per IC docs — always set `fee` or handle `BadFee`:

```rust
let fee = transfer_fee(ledger).await?;
transfer(ledger, to, amount, Some(fee)).await?;
```

`ledger/icrc.rs` uses `Call::bounded_wait` + `icrc-ledger-types::TransferArg`.

Wallet `depositForSwap`: ICRC transfer to trade canister → `credit_from_wallet`.

---

## 7. Cycle budget — 1,000 active traders

Assumptions:
- 1,000 users with trading balance
- 3 swaps/user/day average → **3,000 swaps/day**
- Warm `icrc2_approve` (re-approve 10%/month)
- Quote via trade canister query (M1 composite)

### Per action (operator cycles)

| Action | Inter-canister updates | Cycles (est.) |
|--------|------------------------|---------------|
| `get_swap_quote` | 0 (composite query) | **~0** |
| `execute_swap` | 1 (`depositFromAndSwap`) | **~47M** |
| Re-approve | +1 ledger | **~87M** |
| `depositForSwap` | 1 ledger (wallet) | **~47M** |
| Treasury sweep | 1/hour | ~40M |
| Motoko swap (today) | 7 | **~280M** |

### Daily totals (1k users, 3 swaps/day)

| Item | Calculation | Cycles/day |
|------|-------------|------------|
| Swaps | 3,000 × 47M | **141B** |
| Re-approves | 100 × 40M | 4B |
| Deposits | 200 × 47M | 9.4B |
| Treasury sweeps | 24 × 40M | 1B |
| Quotes | 10k × 0 | ~0 |
| **Trade total** | | **~155B/day** |
| Motoko equivalent | 3,000 × 280M | **840B/day** |
| **Savings** | | **~5.4× less** |

### Monthly / runway

| Metric | Trade canister | Motoko (swap in wallet) |
|--------|----------------|-------------------------|
| Swap traffic/month | ~4.65T cycles | ~25.2T cycles |
| Idle memory (~3 MB stable) | ~1B/month | (inside wallet) |
| **1T balance runway (swap only)** | ~6.5 days at 1k users | ~1.2 days equivalent load on wallet |

**Recommendation:** auto-top-up trade canister at **5T**; alert at **2T**.  
Keep **≥2T** freezing reserve per `dfx canister status`.

### Per-user cycle cost (operator)

| Users | Swaps/day (3/user) | Trade cycles/day | Per user/day |
|-------|-------------------|------------------|--------------|
| 100 | 300 | ~15.5B | ~155M |
| 1,000 | 3,000 | ~155B | ~155M |
| 10,000 | 30,000 | ~1.55T | ~155M |

Linear in swap count — design stays healthy at 1k users.

---

## 8. Stable memory — 1,000 users

| Structure | Entries | Bytes (est.) |
|-----------|---------|--------------|
| `CONFIG` | 1 | 500 |
| `POOL_CACHE` | 50 pairs | 6 KB |
| `BALANCES` | 1k × 3 tokens | **~300 KB** |
| `ESCROWS` (sparse) | &lt;50 | &lt;50 KB |
| `HISTORY` (M2, capped) | 50k rows | ~5 MB |
| **Total stable** | | **~3–6 MB** |

Idle burn: ~127k cycles/sec/GB → **~33M cycles/day** at 3 MB (negligible vs swaps).

Wasm module target: **&lt;2 MB** shrunk.

