## 13. Security checklist (before mainnet)

- [ ] `credit_from_wallet` — caller == `wallet_canister` only
- [ ] `reject_anonymous` on all user swaps
- [ ] `amount_out_min` enforced on `depositFromAndSwap`
- [ ] Reconcile: `sum(balances) ≤ on-chain ICRC balance per token
- [ ] Rate limit: 10 swaps / 60s per principal (stable map)
- [ ] One in-flight swap per user
- [ ] `getUserUnusedBalance` recovery path tested

