| Cycles/swap | **~47M** (vs ~280M Motoko) |
| Time/swap | **~2–5s** (1 pool update) |
| 1k users / 3 swaps/day | **~155B cycles/day** operator cost |
| Memory @ 1k users | **~3 MB** stable |
| Plan rating | **8.5 / 10** |

